Value FLAGS ([*><adehisS?]+(?:[ \t]+[*><adehisS?]+)*)
Value Filldown,Required NETWORK ((?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}(?:/\d+)?)
Value Required NEXT_HOP ((?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3})
Value ATTRIBUTES (.+)
Value List PATH_CONTINUATION (\d+(?:\.\d+)?(?:\s+\d+(?:\.\d+)?)*(?:\s*[ie?])?)

Start
  ^\s*Network\s+NextHop\s+MED\s+LocPrf\s+PrefVal\s+Path/Ogn\s*$$ -> Rows

Rows
  ^\s*Network\s+NextHop\s+MED\s+LocPrf\s+PrefVal\s+Path/Ogn\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Network\s+NextHop\s+MED\s+LocPrf\s+PrefVal\s+Path/Ogn\s*$$ -> Clearall
  ^\s*(?:VPN instance:|BGP local router ID|Total number of routes:) -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*(?:VPN instance:|BGP local router ID|Total number of routes:) -> Clearall Start
  ^\s*(?:[*><adehisS?]+(?:[ \t]+[*><adehisS?]+)*\s+)?(?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}(?:/\d+)?\s+(?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*(?:${FLAGS}\s+)?${NETWORK}\s+${NEXT_HOP}\s+${ATTRIBUTES}\s*$$
  ^\s*[*><adehisS?]+(?:[ \t]+[*><adehisS?]+)*\s+(?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*${FLAGS}\s+${NEXT_HOP}\s+${ATTRIBUTES}\s*$$
  ^\s+${PATH_CONTINUATION}\s*$$
